    <h2>Service</h2>
    <p>Hutba provides live machine translation of sermons for mosque communities. Translations are produced automatically and may contain mistakes.</p>

    <h2>Trial and payment</h2>
    <p>New accounts get a 30-day free trial without payment details. After the trial the plan costs €20 per month, billed yearly in advance (€240). Additional languages cost €5 per month each, and an own domain (e.g. hutba.your-mosque.com) costs €5 per month. Without payment, the account continues on the free plan (60 minutes of broadcasting per calendar month, one listener language); no other action is taken.</p>

    <h2>Fair use</h2>
    <p>The plan includes up to 3 hours of broadcasting per week.</p>

